  <!-- Timing / Cost -->
  <section class="section timing">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Why timing matters — Gastonia AC Repair</p>
      <h2>Every Hour <em>Costs More</em></h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The real price of delayed AC repair. Small problems escalate fast in summer heat.</p>
      <p>
        Gastonia summers regularly push temperatures past 95°F — and your air conditioner
        bears every degree of that strain. A <strong>Refrigerant Leak Repair</strong> that costs a few hundred dollars
        today can turn into a <strong>compressor replacement</strong> costing thousands if ignored.
        <strong>Same-Day AC Repair</strong> isn't just about comfort — it's about protecting your investment.
      </p>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-time">Today</span>
          <p><strong>Minor symptom</strong> — warm air, weak flow. Fast fix, low cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-time">3–5 Days</span>
          <p><strong>Coil freezing</strong> or refrigerant loss worsens. Bill climbing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-time">1–2 Weeks</span>
          <p><strong>Compressor overworking</strong> — risk of burnout begins. Costly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item danger">
          <span class="timeline-time">2+ Weeks</span>
          <p><strong>Full system failure.</strong> Replacement likely. Avoidable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section id="process" class="section process">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">AC Repair Process — Gastonia, NC</p>
      <h2>How We Restore <em>Your Comfort</em></h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Every Gastonia AC repair follows a structured, transparent process.
        No guesswork. No surprises. Just a clear path from diagnosis to restored cooling.
      </p>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <h3>Scheduling & Same-Day Response</h3>
          <p>Our dispatch team confirms your appointment quickly — often offering <strong>Same-Day AC Repair</strong> availability. We gather a brief symptom overview so the technician arrives prepared.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <h3>Precision AC Diagnostic Inspection</h3>
          <p>Thorough system inspection: testing electrical components, measuring refrigerant pressure, checking airflow, and evaluating compressor operation.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <h3>Honest Findings & Repair Options</h3>
          <p>Before any work begins, your technician walks you through exactly what was found — in plain language. You receive a clear written estimate. No pressure.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-num">04</span>
          <h3>Precision Repair & Component Work</h3>
          <p>With your approval, repair begins. Stocked vehicles enable most repairs on the first visit. Every component meets manufacturer specifications.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-num">05</span>
          <h3>System Test & Comfort Confirmation</h3>
          <p>Full operational test: supply air temperature, static pressure, thermostat response, complete cooling cycle. You feel the difference before we leave.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Location / Map -->
